# UI env (apps/app). Server secrets live ONLY in services/api/.env.local —
# nothing here is read by the browser except NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL (origin,
# never a secret). Dashboard ALWAYS reads via src/lib/api.ts apiFetch()
# (/api/* → NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL); apps/app/src/app/api/ is deleted.
# Standalone backend base (services/api on :3002 locally, Containers/Pages URL in prod).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3002
